    "Before acting, Noria re-checks every item: anything that changed since the scan, is protected, or is excluded is skipped.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antes de actuar, Noria vuelve a comprobar cada elemento: se omite todo lo que haya cambiado desde el análisis, esté protegido o excluido."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Build products and package-manager caches.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Productos de compilación y cachés de gestores de paquetes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bundle measured as a whole; its contents are not listed separately.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paquete medido en conjunto; su contenido no se lista por separado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache folder of a third-party app. Usually rebuilt automatically, but the app may need to download data again. Quit the app before cleaning.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Carpeta de caché de una app de terceros. Normalmente se regenera sola, pero la app puede tener que volver a descargar datos. Cierra la app antes de limpiar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache managed by macOS or an Apple app. Noria does not touch it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caché administrada por macOS o una app de Apple. Noria no la toca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache of %@. It is rebuilt automatically when needed. Quit the app before cleaning.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caché de %@. Se regenera automáticamente cuando hace falta. Cierra la app antes de limpiar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
